        "height": 0.31,
        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "林爷爷在那儿。胡爷爷的鞋，我刚才跨过去了。二姨婆呢？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-blood-repeat",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
